## many outcomes
tone: Danger
--- discord ---
### Don't post here
Posting here adds a case under **Honeypot**. Depending on earlier cases, Quack will give you a warning, time you out for 1 hour, remove you from the server, or ban you.
This channel catches spam accounts. Staff can post here safely.
-# 42 honeypot cases so far.
